<title>BRAZIL: Brazil July 11 coffee regs 2.57 mln bags to Sept.</title>
<headline>Brazil July 11 coffee regs 2.57 mln bags to Sept.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil coffee sales registrations as of July 11 totalled 2.57 million 60-kg bags for July, August and September, according to the July 18 bulletin of the Rio de Janeiro Coffee Center.</p>
<p>Of this, 1.39 million bags had been registered for July.</p>
<p>A breakdown by month was as follows.</p>
<p> MONTH     REG 60-KG BAGS-July 11    REG 60-KG BAGS-July 4</p>
<p> July		   1,389,174		1,410,174</p>
<p> August		   790,584		  612,919</p>
<p> September		389,110		  336,248</p>
<p> TOTAL		  2,568,868		2,359,341</p>
<p>((-Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151))</p>
